get_term": "态射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节具体考察纤维积（fibre products），所在的范畴（category）由从一个范畴（category）到集合（sets）范畴（category）的反变（contravariant）函子（functors）组成。以后在讨论景（sites）、预层（presheaves）、层（sheaves）时，后面的讨论将取代这里的内容。其中略有趣味的是这类函子（functors）之间的“可表（representable）态射（morphism）”概念。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:bc994b9443b6801112c6d4c21b34d3695f2aeec907b42f6f894fab4d079cadd6", "unit_id": "tag:0021:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "函子范畴中的纤维积；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"context": "函子范畴、定义域及值域范畴；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "这里的函子的变性；暂定译法。", "source_term": "contravariant", "target_term": "反变"}, {"context": "本节考察的反变函子；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "函子的取值；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "后续讨论中的范畴论概念；暂定译法。", "source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "后续讨论的预层；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"context": "后续讨论的层；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "函子之间的可表态射；暂定译法。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"context": "函子之间的态射；词表无批准项。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}]}
